    {
      "bbox": [
        180,
        1436,
        1869,
        1682
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to implement my Executive Order No. 5 relative to vacancy fillings, I have today appointed a Vacancy Control Board, responsible to me only, to investigate and recommend for my approval requests for the filling of certain positions in the City's service.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.25,
          "min": -1.3482
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0212
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15009,
        "area_px": 394706,
        "density": 0.03803,
        "chars": 262,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        183,
        1732,
        1848,
        1931
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Although the curtailment of fillings is of paramount importance for the fiscal stability of our City government, it should be obvious that the health, safety and general welfare of our citizens must not be impaired.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2449,
          "min": -1.3149
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0032,
          "min": -0.1241
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10981,
        "area_px": 316977,
        "density": 0.03464,
        "chars": 215,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.58
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        183,
        1981,
        1921,
        2180
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I am therefore instructing the heads of all agencies to examine carefully their needs and to request filling only those positions which if not filled would imperil the most vital services of the City.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2326,
          "min": -1.3333
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0141
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9052,
        "area_px": 330200,
        "density": 0.02741,
        "chars": 200,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.09
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        180,
        2230,
        1949,
        2527
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Vacancy Control Board, consisting of Dr. Timothy Costello, the Deputy Mayor-City Administrator, Eugene Becker, the Acting Director of the Budget, and Solomon Hoberman, the Acting Personnel Director will make available to me their combined experience in the fields of management, budget, fiscal and personnel practices.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2459,
          "min": -1.269
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 62,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0067
        }
